  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Leo. Today is my grandma's birthday. We are a big family. We eat lunch at a big table. Grandma wears a green dress. Her glasses are red. Her handbag is brown. It is on the chair. Grandma is happy.",
      "I have a burger. It is big. Dad has rice. Mom has a pie. My sister has chips. Grandma has a small egg. \"Is it good?\" asks Mom. \"Yes, it is!\" I say. I see a lot of food. I like my burger.",
      "Then the cake comes. It is pink and white. I count ten grapes on the cake. \"Let's sing!\" says Dad. We sing, \"Happy birthday!\" I sing with my sister. Grandma smiles. \"Thank you,\" she says. Grandma gives me a grape. I love cake."
    ],
    "summary": "Leo and his family eat lunch for Grandma's birthday. Leo tells us about Grandma's clothes, the food, and the cake.",
